/**

So the basic structure would be

action divider
action start
action plan
{
[
action step  x p times        ...(for the same file/fileleaf/tagnode/metadatafile)
action_name_checkpoint        ...(for above file)
]            x q times        ...(for total number of files/fileleafs/tagnodes/metadatafiles)
action_category_checkpoint    ...(for above category)
}            x r times        ...(for all categories in action)
action_end



In normal cases, and in the default situation,
the actions are independant of each other. 
thus each action is its own actionowner
hence the value in it is true

But in the case of copy cut paste,
multiple actions are triggered one after the other in order to complete the whole event
thus the individual actions are not the action owners
so the first paste action gets the actionowner true 
and all the actions it calls get actionowner false
then once the function finishes and paste ends, then again that end will get the tag as actionowner true



*/